    "source_excerpt": "Stopping lithium might cause a return of symptoms (relapse), especially if it is stopped quickly. If you keep taking lithium, your healthcare provider can check your blood levels of lithium throughout pregnancy. You might need to increase your dose during pregnancy to prevent relapse. Talk with your healthcare provider about monitoring and adjusting your lithium dose as needed."
